Why: links //quickie (engine/quickie/BUILD.gn) into the browser on macOS. GN args cannot add
dependencies, and //chrome/browser cannot depend on //quickie (//quickie depends on it), so the
group that every Chrome binary depends on does.
Against: Chromium 156.0.8078.109 with ungoogled-chromium 156.0.8078.79-1 applied.

--- a/chrome/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/BUILD.gn
@@ -1664,6 +1664,11 @@
     "//v8:v8_headers",
   ]
 
+  # Quickie: the shell, the cxx bridge and the BrowserWindow host (engine/quickie).
+  if (is_mac) {
+    public_deps += [ "//quickie" ]
+  }
+
   if (enable_printing) {
     public_deps += [ "//printing" ]
   }
